  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Honest Man**: back after 45 archived shows (1324 days) [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2010-08-29.m260.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 127 min; rated 5/5 by 6 [1]. Said about its sound: The Telefunkens instruments produced excellent audio quality in this specific track [6]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This venue hosted the Jam on the River festival every Memorial Day weekend [4]\n- The band played with high intensity during this final concert of the tour [4]\n- The reviewer attended a lively after-party with humorous, dedicated music fans [4]\n- The crowd behaved respectfully from a front-of-bar position during the performance [6]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2010-08-29.m260.flac16**: taped by Jesse Hurlburt; source: (FOB) Telefunken USA Ela m260 tubes (cards, NOS) > Lunatec V3 > MT2 @ 24/48 [1]",
